## Main Commands

All commands run through Docker.

### Installation
```bash
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec app bin/setup --skip-server
```

### Development
```bash
docker compose exec app bin/dev
docker compose exec app bin/rails console
docker compose exec app bin/rails routes
```

### Database
```bash
# Migrations
docker compose exec app {{MIGRATION_RUN_COMMAND}}

# Create migration
docker compose exec app {{MIGRATION_CREATE_COMMAND}}
```

### Tests
```bash
# All tests
docker compose exec app {{TEST_COMMAND}}

# System tests
docker compose exec app {{SYSTEM_TEST_COMMAND}}

# With coverage (SimpleCov)
docker compose exec app env COVERAGE=true {{TEST_COMMAND}}
```

### Quality
```bash
# Lint
docker compose exec app bin/rubocop

# Security
docker compose exec app bin/brakeman --no-pager -q
docker compose exec app bundle exec bundler-audit check --update

# Full local CI (Rails 8.1)
docker compose exec app bin/ci
```

